* ==============================================================================
* LM393 Dual Precision Voltage Comparator Macromodel
* Original Texas Instruments / National Semiconductor Model (Downloaded from web)
*
* Standard 5-Pin Comparator Connections:
*   Node 1: Non-inverting input (IN+)
*   Node 2: Inverting input (IN-)
*   Node 3: Positive power supply (V+)
*   Node 4: Negative power supply (V-)
*   Node 5: Open collector output (OUT)
* ==============================================================================
.SUBCKT LM393 1 2 3 4 5
  F1    9  3 V1 1
  IEE   3  7 DC 100.0E-6
  VI1  21  1 DC .75
  VI2  22  2 DC .75
  Q1    9 21  7 QIN
  Q2    8 22  7 QIN
  Q3    9  8  4 QMO
  Q4    8  8  4 QMI
.MODEL QIN PNP(IS=800.0E-18 BF=2.000E3)
.MODEL QMI NPN(IS=800.0E-18 BF=1002)
.MODEL QMO NPN(IS=800.0E-18 BF=1000 CJC=1E-15 TR=807.4E-9)
  E1   10  4  9  4  1
  V1   10 11 DC 0
  Q5    5 11  4 QOC
.MODEL QOC NPN(IS=800.0E-18 BF=20.29E3 CJC=1E-15 TF=942.6E-12 TR=543.8E-9)
  DP    4  3 DX
  RP 3  4 46.3E3
.MODEL DX D(IS=800.0E-18)
.ENDS LM393

* ==============================================================================
* LM393_DIP: Dual Comparator (8-Pin DIP/SOIC Package)
* Pinout (DIP-8): 1OUT 1IN- 1IN+ V- 2IN+ 2IN- 2OUT V+
* ==============================================================================
.SUBCKT LM393_DIP 1OUT 1IN- 1IN+ V- 2IN+ 2IN- 2OUT V+
X1 1IN+ 1IN- V+ V- 1OUT LM393
X2 2IN+ 2IN- V+ V- 2OUT LM393
.ENDS LM393_DIP

.subckt DUT 1OUT 1IN- 1IN+ V- 2IN+ 2IN- 2OUT V+
X1 1OUT 1IN- 1IN+ V- 2IN+ 2IN- 2OUT V+ LM393
.ends DUT
